This build uses Critical Strikes to fuel the energy costs of Flash Enchantments and a Scythe for respectable AoE damage.

== Attributes and Skills ==
<pvxbig>
[build prof=A/D crit=11+1+1 Scythe=10 EarthPrayers=10][Staggering Force][Wounding Strike][Aura of Thorns][Twin Moon Sweep][Malicious Strike][Optional][Way of the Master][Critical Agility][/build]
'''Optional:'''
* {{skill pvxicon|Sand Shards|10}}: For a bigger spike
* {{skill pvxicon|Radiant Scythe|10}}: For energy and damage
* {{skill pvxicon|Reap Impurities|10}}: For armor-ignoring AoE damage. Deep Wound will be covered by Bleeding.
* {{skill pvxicon|Asuran Scan}}
* {{skill pvxicon|"I Am Unstoppable!"}}
* Other PvE skills
