== Equipment ==
* Blessed or Nightstalker's Insignia
* Vampiric/Zealous Scythe of Defense/Fortitude (15%>50 or 15% while enchanted inscription)
* Defensive set

== Usage ==
* Maintain Way of the Master and Critical Agility during battle.
* Use Staggering Force → Wounding Strike → Aura of Thorns → Twin Moon Sweep.
* Spam Malicious Strike, and any other attacks you bring.

== Counters ==
* General anti-melee
* Enchantment removal

